  "description": "The Kink Crosscut is a modern-day beast of a frame. The double-butted toptube and downtube with both upper and lower gussets will stand up to the hardest riding, and the short 12.5” chainstay length and quick 75.5° headtube angle make this frame nice and nimble. The generous 9.25” standover height gives the frame a clean and traditional look, but with the aforementioned modern-day geometry. The all new investment cast chainstay yoke enables you to ride any modern tire size up to 2.55” and run your choice of 25t or 28t sprocket. This frame also comes standard with an integrated seat post clamp, integrated chain tensioners, and removeable brake mounts.\n\nChainstay Bridge\n\nAll new investment cast chainstay yoke enables you to ride any modern tire size.\n\nDropout and Tensioners\n\nLaser cut with integrated chain tensioners.\n\nHeadtube and Gussets\n\nFeaturing full gussets both top and bottom.",
